@startuml
left to right direction

actor Student
actor Administrator

rectangle "Smart Campus Study Room Booking System" {

    usecase "UC-01\nView Room Availability" as UC01
    usecase "UC-02\nBook Study Room" as UC02
    usecase "UC-03\nCancel Booking" as UC03

    usecase "UC-04\nBlock / Unblock Room" as UC04
    usecase "UC-05\nReview Room Usage" as UC05
    usecase "UC-06\nSend Booking Confirmation" as UC06
}

Student --> UC01
Student --> UC02
Student --> UC03

Administrator --> UC04
Administrator --> UC05
Administrator --> UC06

note bottom of UC01
Assumptions:
- A blocked room is not available for booking.
- A booking lasts exactly 2 hours.
- Bookings that only touch at the
  end/start time do not overlap.
- Student and Administrator are
  the only actors in the approved scenario.
- UC-01 to UC-06 are independent goals;
  no <<include>> or <<extend>> is required.
end note

@enduml